# The granted -10 says "target creature", not "you control": Bot1's Jace token (Avatar's landfall 2 and Jace's Machinations 8,
# all on turn 1) targets Bot2's Ornithopter on turn 3 and puts a +1/+1 counter on it for each land Bot1 controls (the Island,
# and a second one played on turn 3: two counters, "you" being the planeswalker's controller and not the creature's). The
# Avatar gets none.

